      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti/blob/ca32605ff53921fa0689dd312618b7cfaafa7e43/TauCeti/Analysis/ODE/LyapunovPerron/VectorField.lean#L331",
        "note": "Lean 4 / Mathlib (TauCeti, Apache-2.0), concurrent: the stable and unstable manifold theorem for an equilibrium of a C^n vector field (a flow) in a finite-dimensional real normed space, for a linearization with an exponential dichotomy (ContinuousLinearMap.exists_localStableGraph_of_contDiffAt and exists_localUnstableGraph_of_contDiffAt, the latter at line 368; the vector-field theorem was first committed on 2026-11-06), by a Lyapunov-Perron contraction on bounded continuous curves and the implicit function theorem. It derives the dichotomy from the spectral condition, no eigenvalue on the imaginary axis (exists_projection_exponential_bounds_of_charpoly in ExponentialDichotomy/Hyperbolic.lean), and has superposition operators on bounded continuous functions (FDeriv/BoundedContinuousFunction.lean). It treats flows, with the spectral condition on the imaginary axis; this work treats maps, with the spectral condition on the unit circle, and does not use or adapt that development.",
        "relationship": "independent"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/leanprover/lean-eval/blob/8955681b9914d7ebc7d286414843021b7d6c9de1/LeanEval/Dynamics/StableUnstableManifolds.lean#L51",
        "note": "Lean 4 / Mathlib (lean-eval benchmark, Apache-2.0): a statement with sorry, without a public proof, of the set-level part of the theorem for a C1 map of R^n with invertible hyperbolic derivative at a fixed point: some open U containing the fixed point has local stable and unstable sets, defined as in this work, meeting only at the point. It does not state that they are manifolds. A copy is a wanted theorem in facebookresearch/atlas-lean (WantedExt/Dynamics/StableUnstableManifoldsWanted.lean at commit 970aaf746442807f27e40b02f0e36d1098c53ad7). This work does not use or adapt it.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/Manzatto/conditioned-stochastic-stability-hyperbolic/blob/0cdb3050d873d931f9f522d60bf6521f7b3ef489/LeanShared/Dynamics/HyperbolicBackwardTransform.lean#L112",
        "note": "Lean 4 / Mathlib (Apache-2.0): a Lyapunov-Perron transform on bounded sequences for a split hyperbolic map with a Lipschitz perturbation, proved Lipschitz, used for shadowing; no stable manifold theorem. This work does not use or adapt it.",
        "relationship": "independent"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/Robertboy18/PDEAtlas/blob/64eb0329c66b121bf37cba88e58f1506b99002a2/PDE/Analysis/Evolution/ODE/InvariantGraph/Local.lean#L36",
        "note": "Lean 4 / Mathlib (PDEAtlas, Apache-2.0): a local C2 center manifold for a finite diagonal linear system with a smooth remainder, by a Lyapunov-Perron argument on weighted paths, and a discrete-time hyperbolic splitting in real Hilbert spaces through the Riesz projection (PDE/Analysis/Spectral/UnstableSplitting.lean, exists_unstable_splitting). This work does not use or adapt it.",
        "relationship": "independent"
